-- What the owners' circulars that employ teaching staff under Ofek Hadash
-- (תשע"ג/3 to תשפ"ו/2, with the advances circular תשע"ד/3) print in the same words (MMS-775):
-- each such declaration is declared here once and imported by every circular
-- that prints it. A circular cites the rows a declaration encodes in a note
-- where the declaration stood; above each one here is where it is printed.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT common

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
`27.5 years of seniority is in neither band of 3.3` MEANS
    (NOT (27.5 AT MOST 27)) AND (NOT (27.5 AT LEAST 28))

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
GIVEN `joining year` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year in whose September the teacher joined the reform's terms
      `degree year` IS A NUMBER @desc when the degree certificates were presented, on the same scale: the calendar year of the September a school year opens, plus the fraction of that school year (2016.5 = half way through the school year that opened in September 2016)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to salary differences` `joining year` `degree year` IF
    `degree year` MINUS min `joining year` 2013 AT MOST 4

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
GIVEN `approved by the division head` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `joins by exception` `approved by the division head` IF
    `approved by the division head`

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
GIVEN `years of internship` IS A NUMBER
      `completed degree and certificate within the internship` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an intern may go on under the reform` `years of internship` `completed degree and certificate within the internship` IF
    `years of internship` AT MOST 2 OR `completed degree and certificate within the internship`

-- circular תשע"ג/3, circular תשע"ד/1, circular תשפ"ב/2 and circular תשפ"ג/2
`working days of a full position` MEANS 5

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
GIVEN w IS A `work week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `total hours` w IS
    w's `frontal hours` PLUS w's `individual hours` PLUS w's `stay hours`

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
`the principal's position` MEANS 100%

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
GIVEN `complexity` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the first deputy's frontal hours` `complexity` IS
    IF `complexity` AT MOST 2 THEN 11 ELSE 9

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
`principals and first deputies work 40 hours` MEANS 40

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
`a principal mother's stay hours off` MEANS 2.5

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
GIVEN `age` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a principal's age hours off non-frontal work` `age` IS
    IF `age` AT LEAST 50 THEN 2 ELSE 0

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
GIVETH A LIST OF Party
DECIDE `the parties 6.1.1 names to install the clock` IS EMPTY

-- circular תשע"ג/3 and circular תשע"ד/1
`6.1.1 names no one to install the clock` MEANS
    `the parties 6.1.1 names to install the clock` EQUALS EMPTY

-- circular תש"ף/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
`the deputy example's components` MEANS
    LIST 6433.83, 172.59, 193.02, 318.75, 441.05, 191.93, 1058.29, 377.96, 2154.38

-- circular תש"ף/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
`the principal example's components` MEANS
    LIST 9982.88, 235.35, 299.49, 494.58, 684.33, 261.72, 297.73, 584.83, 3473.90

