GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the days 2.1(2)(ב) gives for "urgently"` IS NOTHING

-- circular תש"ף/1, circular תשפ"א/1, circular תשפ"ב/2, circular תשפ"ג/2 and circular תשפ"ה/1
`"urgently" names no deadline` MEANS
    `the days 2.1(2)(ב) gives for "urgently"` EQUALS NOTHING

-- circular תש"ף/1 and circular תשפ"א/1
`§5.4's cap on all employments` MEANS 1

-- circular תש"ף/1 and circular תשפ"א/1
`§6.3's exceptional placement reaches` MEANS 1.17

-- circular תש"ף/1, circular תשפ"א/1, circular תשפ"א/4, circular תשפ"ב/1, circular תשפ"ב/2, circular תשפ"ג/1 and circular תשפ"ג/2
`grades a committed non-academic advances before the degree` MEANS 0

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"א/4
`months to complete the degree` MEANS 48

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"א/4
GIVEN `months from joining to the degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `retroactive salary differences from joining` `months from joining to the degree` IF
    `months from joining to the degree` AT MOST `months to complete the degree`

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"א/4
`the starts the text gives for the four years` MEANS
    LIST `the day the commitment was signed`, `the day of joining the reform`

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"א/4
`the starts the text gives for the differences` MEANS
    LIST `the day of joining the reform`, `the day the commitment was signed`

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"א/4
GIVEN `the replaced teacher is on the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
      `on weekly hours` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the substitute is on the reform` `the replaced teacher is on the reform` `on weekly hours` IF
    `on weekly hours` AND `the replaced teacher is on the reform`

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"ו/1
`working days a week at a full position` MEANS 5

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
`promotion of certified academic principals and deputies` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` 1 36 210 (JUST 0.0875), `promotion step` 2 36 210 (JUST 0.0875),
         `promotion step` 3 36 210 (JUST 0.0875)

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"א/4
`study hours that count toward שפ"מ at most` MEANS 60

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"א/4
`grades may be halves` MEANS TRUE

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"ב/1
`the grade a new teacher is placed at` MEANS 1

-- circular תשפ"א/1, circular תשפ"א/4, circular תשפ"ב/1, circular תשפ"ב/2, circular תשפ"ג/1 and circular תשפ"ג/2
GIVEN s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in 3.3.1's printed band` s IF s AT MOST 27

-- circular תשפ"א/1, circular תשפ"א/4, circular תשפ"ב/1, circular תשפ"ב/2, circular תשפ"ג/1 and circular תשפ"ג/2
GIVEN s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in 3.3.2's printed band` s IF s AT LEAST 28

-- circular תשפ"א/1, circular תשפ"ב/2 and circular תשפ"ג/2
GIVEN row IS A `post-primary advance row`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate the printed row gives` row IS
    CONSIDER row
    WHEN `teachers who are not principals or first deputies` THEN 0.27
    WHEN `interns` THEN 0.22
    WHEN `first deputies` THEN 0.20
    WHEN `principals` THEN 0.15

-- circular תשפ"א/1, circular תשפ"ב/2 and circular תשפ"ג/2
GIVETH A LIST OF Party
DECIDE `the parties §16.1 names to install the clock` IS EMPTY

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
GIVEN g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the §4.3 range of grade` g IS IF g AT MOST 6 THEN 1 ELSE 2

-- circular תשפ"א/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
GIVEN gs IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§4.3 gives one week for the grades` gs IF
    all (GIVEN g YIELD `the §4.3 range of grade` g EQUALS 1) gs
    OR all (GIVEN g YIELD `the §4.3 range of grade` g EQUALS 2) gs

-- circular תשפ"א/4, circular תשפ"ב/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
`promotion of certified academics` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` 1 30 120 (JUST 0.075), `promotion step` 2 30 120 (JUST 0.075),
         `promotion step` 3 36 180 (JUST 0.075), `promotion step` 4 36 180 (JUST 0.075),
         `promotion step` 5 36 180 (JUST 0.075), `promotion step` 6 48 210 (JUST 0.075),
         `promotion step` 7 48 210 (JUST 0.075), `promotion step` 8 48 210 (JUST 0.075)

-- circular תשפ"ב/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
`a third of a position` MEANS 1 DIVIDED BY 3

-- circular תשפ"ב/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
GIVEN `months from joining to the degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `arrears from joining under section 3.3.4` `months from joining to the degree` IF
    `months from joining to the degree` AT MOST 48

-- circular תשפ"ב/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
GIVEN `employed on weekly hours` IS A BOOLEAN, `replaced teacher in the reform` IS A BOOLEAN, `otherwise in the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the substitute is employed in the reform` `employed on weekly hours` `replaced teacher in the reform` `otherwise in the reform` IS
    IF `employed on weekly hours` THEN `replaced teacher in the reform` ELSE `otherwise in the reform`

-- circular תשפ"ב/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the period counts toward promotion` f IF
    f AT LEAST `a third of a position`

-- circular תשפ"ב/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
`activity hours a half-year, at most` MEANS 18

-- circular תשפ"ב/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
GIVEN s IS A `promotion step`, months IS A NUMBER, hours IS A NUMBER, `evaluation passed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the step is earned` s months hours `evaluation passed` IF
        months AT LEAST s's `months required`
    AND hours AT LEAST s's `development hours required`
    AND `evaluation passed`

-- circular תשפ"ב/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
`study hours that may count as development hours, at most` MEANS 60

-- circular תשפ"ב/1 and circular תשפ"ב/2
GIVEN `years of seniority` IS A NUMBER, `certified to teach` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an academic may be promoted` `years of seniority` `certified to teach` IF
        `certified to teach`
    OR  `years of seniority` AT LEAST 25

